Read Me

Mapping.R is the code file used for the analyses in R.

FishEggColourForMapping.csv - Column 1 = Species name. Column 2 = Pigment. Column 3-7 = Each individual pigment as present (1) / absent (0).

MapNames.csv - List of species to loop through when generating the maps.

Fish_Raster_Stack - Map files. 

.rds files - Files for each colour after the map has been created.
